<title>SWEDEN: Electrolux sees strong U.S. market.</title>
<headline>Electrolux sees strong U.S. market.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish household appliance group Electrolux AB's chief executive said on Friday he expected the U.S. market to be strong over the next quarters.</p>
<p>&quot;Our opinion is that (the U.S. market) feels strong in the coming quarters,&quot; the company's CEO Leif Johansson told a news conference.</p>
</text>
